 "final_text_tail": "The EXIF handling in `normalize_image` and `_get_image_id_bytes` already swallows exceptions, so the unguarded path is the image load in `ImageMediaIO.load_bytes`. Its `try` only catches `OSError`, `UnidentifiedImageError` and `SyntaxError`, so a different exception from the EXIF-dependent steps escapes as a server error. I have not confirmed this by reproducing it.\n\n{\"files\": [\"vllm/multimodal/media/image.py\", \"vllm/multimodal/image.py\", \"vllm/multimodal/hasher.py\"], \"functions\": [\"ImageMediaIO.load_bytes\", \"normalize_image\", \"_get_image_id_bytes\"]}",
